# Unit-name globs that bmc-services-health leaves out of failed_services and
# service_restarts_total; matching failures still show as failed_services_excluded.
# Image default. Add per-BMC exclusions in /etc/bmc-services-health/exclude.
#
# systemd-coredump runs once per crash and fails when rwfs is full, which the
# rwfs alarm already covers; the crash itself shows in the crashing unit's restarts.
systemd-coredump@*.service
